mod frontend.syntax.printing;

/**
 * PRINTING what the frontend produced (options for the compiler's own developers)
 *
 * The files of this package (module `frontend.syntax.printing`):
 *
 *      syntax_printer.sharp  the -parsetree option
 *      syntax_stats.sharp    the -parsestats option
 *      syntax_errors.sharp   prints the problems of one file
 *
 * This file is the package's front door: it only says what is where.
